  data: {
    LLM: "Do not empty a column unless you have a card ready to put in it immediately. Empty columns are your only 'working space' to shuffle cards around.\n\nPriority Foundation Building: Get the low cards (Aces and 2s) to the foundations as soon as possible. Because there are two of every card, it's easy to accidentally bury a 2 of Spades under a long sequence of other cards.\n\nThe 'Empty Slot' Strategy: Treat an empty column like an extra hand. Use it to temporarily hold a card that is blocking a deep run in another column. If you can clear out two columns, your win percentage skyrockets.",
    Player: "Do not empty a column unless you have a card ready to put in it immediately. Empty columns are your only 'working space' to shuffle cards around.\n\nPriority Foundation Building: Get the low cards (Aces and 2s) to the foundations as soon as possible. Because there are two of every card, it's easy to accidentally bury a 2 of Spades under a long sequence of other cards.\n\nThe 'Empty Slot' Strategy: Treat an empty column like an extra hand. Use it to temporarily hold a card that is blocking a deep run in another column. If you can clear out two columns, your win percentage skyrockets.",
