        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Wait to draw from the stock until you have exhausted all possible moves in the tableau.',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'If you have two identical cards (e.g., two 8 of Diamonds) available to move onto a 9, check which one is blocking more important cards beneath it.',
